<div style="TEXT-INDENT: 0pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt" align="center"><font style="DISPLAY: inline; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman, serif; FONT-SIZE: 3pt"><font style="DISPLAY: inline; FONT-FAMILY: symbol, serif; FONT-SIZE: 10pt">&#183;</font></font></div>
</td>
<td align="left" valign="top" width="96%">
<div style="TEXT-INDENT: 0pt; DISPLAY: block; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt" align="left"><font style="DISPLAY: inline; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; FONT-SIZE: 10pt"><font style="FONT-STYLE: italic; DISPLAY: inline">By Mail.</font>You may vote by proxy by filling out the vote instruction form and returning it in the pre-addressed, postage-paid envelope provided.</font></div>
</td>
</tr><tr>
<td valign="top" width="4%"><font style="DISPLAY: inline; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; FONT-SIZE: 10pt">&#160; </font></td>
